  "boundary": "The selected DamageUnit second list context joins List<DamageProcessorBase>; first CostData and third GameplayTag lists are separate. Pinned union routes 0/2/3/4/5/6/9/10 select AttackCriticalRateProcessorForMemoryPack, AttackerCriticalDamageProcessorForMemoryPack, AttackerPenProcessorForMemoryPack, DamageIndependentHealthProcessorForMemoryPack, DamageScaleProcessorForMemoryPack, DamageTextProcessorForMemoryPack, InstantModifyAttributeForMemoryPack and ModifyCalcResultForMemoryPack. Routes 0/2/3/4 consume header1 and one BlackboardDouble scalar-payload; routes 5/6/9/10 consume header3/BlackboardDouble/DamageScaleSide/zoneName, header2/DamageTextStyle/bool, header2/AttributeModifier/raw DWORD, and header3/BlackboardDouble/ModifyCalcResult.Type/BlackboardDouble respectively. Exact contexts reuse the separately pinned BlackboardDouble and AttributeModifier profiles in buff_root_prefix_native.json. Short/extended union tags, null unions and null wrappers are distinct. The second list reserves the shortest 42-byte remaining DamageUnit tail; unknown processor tags stop before the tag. Static identities are exact, generated wrapper order is named, and selected leaf source order is direct; framing remains structural-only and conditional on the previously pinned shared reference-list consumer. Live inflated provider selection, complete refill/error and allocation parity, arithmetic/attribute behavior, scalar meaning and whole-BuffData EOF remain unresolved. First/third positive unit lists and the effect array remain unsupported; extended tags 130/304 and unselected CalculationBase variants retain their separate boundary."
}
